# NEXUS — Engineering Principles

## 1. Type Safety

TypeScript is used across the application.

---

## 2. Domain First

Business rules live in domain services rather than UI components.

---

## 3. Validation at Boundaries

External input is validated before entering the domain.

---

## 4. AI Is Not the Source of Truth

AI-generated information must be validated against application rules.

---

## 5. Database Integrity

Database constraints should enforce important relationships.

---

## 6. Observable Intelligence

AI and recommendation behavior should be measurable.

---

## 7. Test Critical Logic

Scheduling, task transitions, recommendations, and AI tool execution should have automated tests.

---

## 8. Graceful Failure

Failure of the AI service must not make the core productivity system unusable.

---

## 9. Security by Default

Authorization and validation occur server-side.

---

## 10. Simplicity

Complexity must be justified by a real product requirement.
